 (Q4_K/Q5_K/Q6_K/IQ4_XS, 2..8 cols) - UNMEASURED

Port of the llama.cpp GP100 multi-column kernels onto q8_1 activations (prep kernel
converts to fp16 with exact block sums). Opt-in, off by default; STRATA_B6_F16_CHECK=1
logs rel. RMS vs the exact path. Stopped before any accuracy or speed measurement.

